---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /blog/
title: Blog • Zephyr — Notes & Guides
bodyClass: page--blog
pageId: blog-index
noMarkdownWrapper: true
description: 'Technical notes, desktop setup guides, and development walkthroughs by Zephyr.'
---

<div class="blog-page max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
  <div class="page-intro pb-8 mb-10 border-b border-border max-md:pb-6 max-md:mb-7">
    <span class="page-intro__eyebrow block font-regular text-[0.725rem] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-accent mb-[0.4rem]">// WRITING & NOTES</span>
    <h1 class="page-intro__title font-heading text-[clamp(2rem,4.5vw,2.75rem)] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.035em] leading-[1.1] text-body-text m-0 mb-3 max-md:text-[clamp(1.75rem,6.5vw,2.25rem)]">Technical Blog & Guides</h1>
    <p class="page-intro__desc font-regular text-[0.95rem] leading-[1.7] text-text-muted max-w-[700px] m-0 max-md:text-[0.9rem] max-md:leading-[1.6]">
      Documentation, setup walkthroughs, and personal notes on system configuration, development workflows, and software tooling.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="blog-list flex flex-col gap-6 max-md:gap-5">
    {% for post in collections.blogpost | reverse %}
      <article class="project-card bg-surface border border-border p-6 flex flex-col box-border transition-[border-color,transform] duration-200 ease-default hover:border-accent hover:-translate-y-[2px] max-[480px]:py-4 max-[480px]:px-[14px]">
        <div class="project-card__header flex justify-between items-center mb-4 flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="project-card__tag font-regular text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-text-muted">Technical Guide</span>
          <span class="project-card__status font-regular text-[0.65rem] py-[2px] px-[6px] border border-border text-accent bg-surface-2">{{ post.date | formatDate if post.date else 'Recent' }}</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="project-card__title m-0 mb-3 font-heading text-[1.3rem] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.2] max-[640px]:text-[1.15rem] [&>a]:text-body-text [&>a]:no-underline [&>a]:transition-colors [&>a]:duration-150 [&>a]:ease-default hover:[&>a]:text-accent">
          <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
        </h2>

        <p class="project-card__desc font-regular text-[0.875rem] leading-[1.65] text-text-muted m-0 mb-5 grow">
          {{ post.data.description }}
        </p>

        <div class="project-card__footer border-t border-border pt-4 mt-auto">
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="project-card__action group/action inline-flex items-center gap-[6px] font-regular text-[0.8rem] font-semibold text-accent no-underline transition-[gap] duration-150 ease-default hover:gap-[9px]">
            Read Article
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 3L11 8L6 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="square"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>